<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Reset your ShopFlow password</title></head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 2em auto; color: #1a1a1a;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px;">Reset your ShopFlow password</h1>
  <p>Hi,</p>
  <p>We received a request to reset the password for <strong>{user_email}</strong>.</p>
  <p><a href="{reset_link_url}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #1a73e8; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">Choose a new password</a></p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">Or copy this link: {reset_link_url}</p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">This link expires at {expires_at_utc} UTC. If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email — your password won't change.</p>
  <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2em;">— ShopFlow WMS</p>
</body>
</html>
